---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'; import { pillars } from '../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="A More Conscious Way Forward" description="New Earth brings vision, practical systems and participation into one place." canonical="/"><section class="home-hero"><div class="shell home-hero__content"><p class="eyebrow">A living framework for conscious civilisation</p><h1>A more conscious way forward.</h1><p class="lede">New Earth brings vision, practical systems, and participation into one place so people can understand what is possible and choose a meaningful next step.</p><div class="page-actions"><a class="button" href="/blueprint/">Explore the Blueprint</a><a class="button button-quiet" href="/projects/">See Projects</a></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="shell split"><div><p class="eyebrow">What is New Earth?</p><h2>A place to connect meaning with practice.</h2></div><div><p class="lede">New Earth is a public framework for exploring the ideas, relationships, and projects that can support a more conscious civilisation. It is a place for clear questions, honest progress, and practical participation.</p><a class="text-link" href="/vision/">Read the Vision</a></div></div></section><section class="section section-sand"><div class="shell"><p class="eyebrow">Start with the big picture</p><h2>Follow a clear path into the work.</h2><div class="card-grid five">{[['Vision','/vision/'],['Blueprint','/blueprint/'],['The 12 Pillars','/blueprint/pillars/'],['Projects','/projects/'],['Get Involved','/get-involved/']].map(([label,href])=><a class="card" href={href}><h3>{label}</h3><p>Discover a clear route into New Earth.</p></a>)}</div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="shell"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">The 12 Pillars</p><h2>A framework for seeing the whole.</h2><p>Explore twelve interconnected areas of life through which the New Earth vision can be understood, questioned and developed.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/blueprint/pillars/">View all pillars</a></div><div class="card-grid pillars">{pillars.map(([number,label,slug])=><a class="card" href={`/blueprint/pillars/${slug}/`}><span class="pillar-number">{number}</span><h3>{label}</h3><p>A connected area for exploration.</p></a>)}</div></div></section><section class="section section-sand"><div class="shell split"><div><p class="eyebrow">Ecosystem</p><h2>See how New Earth fits together.</h2></div><div><p class="lede">New Earth connects a shared vision with practical frameworks, areas of life, developing projects and ways for people to participate.</p><a class="text-link" href="/ecosystem/">Explore the Ecosystem</a></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="shell"><p class="eyebrow">Featured projects</p><h2>Explore what we're building.</h2><p>These projects are presented at their current stage, from early research and concepts to active development.</p><div class="card-grid projects"><article class="card"><span class="status">Research</span><h3>MicroGrow AI Lab</h3><p>Exploring how growing systems, local intelligence and practical technology could work together.</p><a class="text-link" href="/projects/microgrow-ai-lab/">Explore project</a></article><article class="card"><span class="status">Concept</span><h3>Field Scanner</h3><p>A handheld concept for discovering, identifying and inspecting connected MicroGrow nodes.</p><a class="text-link" href="/projects/field-scanner/">Explore project</a></article><article class="card"><span class="status">In development</span><h3>New Earth Living</h3><p>A developing app concept connecting people with the New Earth Conscious Living ecosystem.</p><a class="text-link" href="/projects/new-earth-living/">Explore project</a></article></div></div></section><section class="section section-sand"><div class="shell split"><div><p class="eyebrow">Progress and Transparency</p><h2>Follow the work as it develops.</h2></div><p>New Earth is an evolving body of work. As updates become ready to share, they will be dated, placed in context and connected to the relevant part of the ecosystem.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="shell"><p class="eyebrow">Journal and learning</p><h2>Follow the questions as they develop.</h2><p>Use the Journal and Resources routes to find future writing, guides, and learning material when they are approved and published.</p><a class="button" href="/journal/">Open Journal</a></div></section><section class="section section-sand"><div class="shell"><p class="eyebrow">Get Involved</p><h2>Find your way to take part.</h2><p>Start with understanding, then choose a clear route into the work.</p><a class="button" href="/get-involved/">Open Get Involved</a></div></section></BaseLayout>
